Z||000004||Monkeyman||09-05-2000||11:41 PM||||Nothing personal GTBastard, but unless it's one of the older ones, you'd get your doors blown off.  The newer ('89 [I think] and up) Esprits and especially the new V8s are wickedly fast.  And they handle with the best supercars the world has to offer.  And they look twice as good as most of the worlds supercars.  And cost a fraction of the price.  And the insurance is cheaper.  Did I mention the looks?  The older turbo 4s will get almost as good gas mileage (if you stay out of the gas) as any of the 4 cyl grocery getters of the same era.  Why don't I have one?  Just never had the cash at the right time.  Besides, I truly love Fieros. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  ||||reg||1
