Z||000009||Black88GT||09-06-2000||11:30 PM||||Naa I have heard some really bad things from a guy I know who works strictly with "super cars" like Porsche's, Ferrari's, Lambo's etc.  He said they are "wickedly" unreliable and "wickedly" hard to work on.  He said that I should be HAPPY lotus had nothing to do with designing the Fiero suspension in '88! lol.  Keep in mind I am not one to believe the word of mouth thing, especially since I own a Fiero.<P>I have seen a couple new Lotus', they look "exotic" but NOTHING compared to Ferrari's, some Porsche's, and new Lambo's (the old ones look hideous).  One time I thought a Lotus was a fiero rebody.  I made the owner show me the engine.  He was pretty mad...<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||13
